    (v_chapter, 'mcq', 'concept', 'bank', 3, 'An object is thrown vertically straight upward into the air. At the highest point of its flight, the object’s velocity and acceleration are:', '["Velocity is zero, and acceleration is zero","Velocity is zero, and acceleration is equal to acceleration due to gravity","Velocity is maximum, and acceleration is zero","Velocity is maximum, and acceleration is equal to acceleration due to gravity"]'::jsonb, 'B', 1),
